## List Albums

```
GET /albums
```

Returns a paginated list of albums.

### Query Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `offset` | integer | `0` | Items to skip |
| `limit` | integer | `20` | Items per page |

### Response

```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "artist_id": "uuid",
      "title": "Album Title",
      "slug": "album-title",
      "cover_url": "https://...",
      "year": 2024,
      "type": "album",
      "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "total": 30
}
```

## Get Album

```
GET /albums/:id
```

Returns a single album with its tracks.

## Get Random Albums

```
GET /albums/random
```

## Count Albums

```
GET /albums/count
```

## Create / Update / Delete

```
POST /albums          # Create (auth required)
PUT /albums/:id       # Update (auth required)
DELETE /albums/:id    # Delete (auth required)
```
